cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use this dataset, please cite it as below, and credit
  football-data.co.uk as the underlying data source.
title: >-
  premier-league-data: English Premier League Results & Betting Odds Dataset
abstract: >-
  Open, pip-installable English Premier League match results with full
  bookmaker odds (opening and closing lines), every season from 1993-94 to the
  present, shipped as tidy CSV and Parquet tables. Data sourced from
  football-data.co.uk; pipeline code is MIT licensed.
type: dataset
authors:
  - family-names: Khetani
    given-names: Anish
url: "https://github.com/AnishKhetani/premier-league-data"
repository-code: "https://github.com/AnishKhetani/premier-league-data"
license: MIT
version: "0.1.0"
keywords:
  - premier league
  - english premier league
  - epl
  - football
  - soccer
  - match results
  - betting odds
  - closing line
  - open data
  - sports data
  - dataset
references:
  - type: data
    title: Football-Data.co.uk historical results and odds
    url: "https://www.football-data.co.uk/"
    notes: >-
      Underlying source data. This project fetches, cleans, and reshapes their
      freely published files; it claims no ownership over the data.
